# EduPredict AI – Student Performance Prediction System

An end-to-end Machine Learning application that predicts student academic performance and identifies students who may be at academic risk.

## Project Overview

EduPredict AI uses Machine Learning to analyze student-related academic and personal factors and generate predictions that can support early academic intervention.

## Key Features

- Student academic grade prediction
- Student academic risk classification
- Machine Learning prediction pipelines
- Data preprocessing and feature engineering
- Exploratory Data Analysis
- Model comparison and evaluation
- Prediction visualization
- Flask web application
- Automated model testing

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Joblib
- MySQL
- Plotly
- HTML
- CSS

